---
title: AI feature — Natural-language event creation
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Organizer (browser)
  participant C as Controller<br/>Server Action parseEventText
  participant R as RateLimiter<br/>(Postgres)
  participant S as ParseEventTextService
  participant M as AI providers<br/>OpenRouter (default)<br/>+ Anthropic (optional)<br/>(structured output)
  participant Z as Zod schema<br/>(same as manual form)

  O->>C: text + timezone field (prefilled from browser Intl)
  C->>C: require session (Organizer only)
  C->>R: consume("ai:user:{id}", 20/day)
  alt limit exceeded
    R-->>C: denied
    C-->>O: "Daily AI limit reached — fill the form manually"
  else allowed
    C->>S: parse(text, timezone, now)
    Note over S: Timezone priority:<br/>1. explicit in text ("7pm EST")<br/>2. form field (browser prefill)<br/>3. none → missing["timezone"]
    alt no provider configured (no key on the server)
      S-->>O: "AI fill isn't set up on this server — fill the form below."
    else at least one provider configured
      S->>M: prompt + context "Today is Thu 2026-09-24 23:00, America/Fortaleza"<br/>one 20 s budget for all providers
      Note over S,M: Providers in AI_PROVIDERS order (default openrouter only)<br/>Outage (network, 5xx, 429, 401/403, timeout, credit) → next listed provider if ≥ 1 s is left<br/>Invalid output, other 4xx → no retry, no failover
      alt last attempt timed out, or the 20 s budget ran out before a next provider could be tried
        M-->>S: timeout
        S-->>O: "The AI took too long to answer — try again, or fill the form below."
      else every provider failed some other way, or invalid output
        M-->>S: error
        S-->>O: "The AI service is unavailable right now — try again later, or fill the form below."
      else structured response
        M-->>S: { isEvent, name, description, date, time, timezone, location }
        S->>Z: validate per field
        Z-->>S: valid fields + missing[]
        alt isEvent is false
          S-->>C: notAnEvent: true, all fields null
          C-->>O: "Couldn't find event details in that text."
        else isEvent is true
          S-->>C: ParseResult (fields + missing[])
          C-->>O: fill form · highlight missing fields
        end
      end
    end
  end
  Note over O,Z: The AI never saves. The Organizer reviews and clicks Save.
